# macOS capture

Follow the capture invariants in root `AGENTS.md` and `internal/capture/macos/README.md`. Treat the helper and Go adapter as one boundary; keep non-Darwin stubs building.

- The app and `CaptureDefaults.chunkSeconds` use 2-second chunks. Go assembles utterance windows in `internal/service/capture_pipeline.go`.
- Helper commands are `list`, `capture`, and `stop`; `capture` requires `--bundle-id` and `--spool`.
- `swift build` works with Command Line Tools. `swift test` requires full Xcode; `scripts/verify.sh` handles the XCTest skip on macOS.
